    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-ed8d5f19-abac-4a16-8566-36ba0b7dfd24" n="1792" facs="#m-7fa0198c-8133-45ce-9ba5-7df1c0487c57" /><div xml:id="m-2ce33b8a-4649-4b50-92ed-fb8cf6bcbcfa">
            <lg xml:id="m-2472e834-177f-4fa3-9725-667695377c3d">
              <l xml:id="m-51858eba-6579-40cf-b916-8ee00c0620cd" facs="#m-037b78bd-3226-4bae-ac48-16f266d4190e" label="ambiguous">1570</l><l xml:id="m-f836c825-a717-4f7e-927c-f362da934419" facs="#m-8c943266-714d-4f63-a54c-34aa914f4754" label="ambiguous">Iuly 24. 25.</l><l xml:id="m-da1577cb-b4a3-4466-8910-a00360dd4500" facs="#m-64c55e6b-d5ca-400a-b57f-047195b08de9" label="ambiguous">24.</l><l xml:id="m-e61a59d3-5c90-42e2-a445-1864089b5c17" facs="#m-aae8446e-fd48-4aeb-97e4-f820916b0519" label="text-like">St. Christina, Virgin and Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-659715f3-7a52-4bef-be4d-bc9b24dc302c" facs="#m-5de59a6b-67de-4f1d-a494-93d88628282c" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-0dbd693c-5840-45bc-b770-ea56f2f95f64" facs="#m-03c876a3-4334-497a-acb7-08d995d504e9" label="lyrics-like">(Ndulgéntiam nobis, quaésumus! grata semper éxstitit et mérito ca¬</l><l xml:id="m-dae7f45d-a551-442e-af46-160077dc7444" facs="#m-d6f233e2-573d-4dc4-8341-c949fba3ef0f" label="lyrics-like">L Dómine, beáta Christina Virgo! stitátis, et tuae professióne virtútis.</l><l xml:id="m-59268597-395b-4ec3-aa67-684dbbf77cce" facs="#m-599c656e-9b03-45e9-a530-a60f14f77d9d" label="lyrics-like">et Martyr implóret:“quae tibil Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e5b16328-1cc9-452f-8558-18a1c0f68b0a" facs="#m-4f995880-4c6c-436f-9500-a85bd97ac24c" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Hóstias tibi. and Postcommunion. Divini múneris. p. 1224.</l><l xml:id="m-c1bd2f42-e050-4c1c-b9f6-a486f84a3ce5" facs="#m-46433ab4-d60c-470c-a2f3-9b2f8c2b783f" label="ambiguous">25.</l><l xml:id="m-993bc1d4-b579-411d-b3e4-3ecbaf9438e9" facs="#m-537aa448-19ba-4cbd-8b09-f247eb9c2a09" label="ambiguous">SAINT JAMES, APOSTLE.</l><l xml:id="m-fbc3d241-cfa1-44ea-890f-3ba72866730e" facs="#m-309c7dcd-db85-4596-baa6-7cb4832c3ed5" label="text-like">Double of the Second Class.</l><l xml:id="m-e1cbf227-e8da-4e7b-9afa-778d879ad8d0" facs="#m-100e562a-3ffb-44d9-9daa-dad3fceafae4" label="text-like">At Vespers and at the Little Hours, all from the Common of</l><l xml:id="m-8cdf32b0-78a3-498c-9862-7ba3125419dc" facs="#m-7ee8ab7a-a3c5-41ef-bfed-09028744122d" label="ambiguous">Apostles, p. IlII.</l><l xml:id="m-af603521-78d1-4a26-967d-398a9c758f27" facs="#m-12d795cc-d89b-4ed0-9690-fbb9cbde6d5b" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Esto Dómine. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-23f0b232-6061-448e-9249-db1aa2b6dfc9" facs="#m-571662a6-5fdf-4ea6-94c1-354eda41f713" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-fe93ff9e-1f7c-4197-8619-7b8e35ace8c0" facs="#m-48576864-bb60-478d-96e0-08f8f0a66fa8" label="text-like">Introit. Mihi autem. p. 1304.</l><l xml:id="m-7f415ebe-d83b-4ab0-8da2-5276a946f88b" facs="#m-5e344b0e-988a-4915-9121-4b4abda80173" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-18ff39c4-6769-4439-91c5-7562779faee5" facs="#m-d3588ca5-b940-411a-813f-e2d9bafde717" label="lyrics-like">(Sto Dómine plebi tuae sanctifi¬ conversatióne tibi pláceat, et secúra</l><l xml:id="m-840225f0-3ed0-4a43-ac32-d20c2df70728" facs="#m-c200d270-2092-498d-8bd4-b927754a8aa5" label="lyrics-like">C cátor et custos : t ut Apóstoli mente desérviat. Per Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-ccdb3371-4e91-4e0f-99dc-59b4da49f21d" facs="#m-86a726b8-5349-4f80-b91c-b9a7aa975c31" label="lyrics-like">tui Jacóbi munita praesidiis, *et nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-56e7c434-1771-4f42-89bb-018e412d0c4e" facs="#m-ffc4d1aa-98f5-4046-834b-934a4c6a14d2" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. T. Cor. 4. b.</l><l xml:id="m-bcac2749-99e6-412a-9939-963e74cb93f0" facs="#m-19d84151-a341-4615-b1eb-870ebd8da196" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Puto quod Deus nos dícimur, et benedicimus : persecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-474a6854-885b-4d68-9350-e2d5bbb8540b" facs="#m-f6b6f50d-390d-4fcb-a451-4b0ef36cba58" label="lyrics-like">Apóstolos novíssimos osténdit,</l><l xml:id="m-5206cb42-5d84-464c-909f-61509cbc4f63" facs="#m-8ef5bcf8-3ad0-4d43-9d1d-851486c72f38" label="lyrics-like">tiónem pátimur, et sustinémus</l><l xml:id="m-eb59dfe6-880e-4e68-8ea8-8f5d8a39f1d9" facs="#m-2bef889e-9704-4cae-a5a7-c53b8addbda1" label="lyrics-like">blasphemámur, et obsecrámus</l><l xml:id="m-7684ee5c-f6f6-4bf0-8673-3dab7e83ef2b" facs="#m-88c43043-d8a1-4524-802e-5a808f012694" label="lyrics-like">tamquam morti destinátos: quia</l><l xml:id="m-89804c5c-af37-4890-bf6b-c26738f11434" facs="#m-ff348397-9369-472a-882b-8368eac799c3" label="ambiguous" /><l xml:id="m-25267fc3-637a-4a23-b353-c8e355879a6e" facs="#m-377111d0-bab4-4277-8f5e-2600badbc9b2" label="lyrics-like">spectáculum facti sumus mundo, et</l><l xml:id="m-4acc018a-4d1e-4ded-809c-ff7c3b1dc51b" facs="#m-5c42e5f3-c82a-4c86-bc99-634a295b89d7" label="lyrics-like">tamquam purgaménta hujus mundi</l><l xml:id="m-92814b2d-5582-45b1-b33f-473763a545b7" facs="#m-6f9787be-f4a0-4a7d-869f-9f8e63269ce4" label="lyrics-like">Angelis, et homínibus. Nos stulti</l><l xml:id="m-c6a5ff93-0d60-4b0a-b484-ee12dfe0b5a0" facs="#m-e45c856e-b30e-4688-bbfd-6761f14c028f" label="lyrics-like">facti sumus ómnium peripséma</l><l xml:id="m-421da1f0-ebb5-4bd2-ae93-58e56bc00e29" facs="#m-f1e5a1f6-aecc-476a-938f-adeb78eaafe0" label="lyrics-like">usque adhuc. Non ut confúndam</l><l xml:id="m-9e0c23db-6e79-473c-9087-1a703f6f0dff" facs="#m-4550143a-4374-454e-a1bc-50a4371dd086" label="ambiguous">propter Christum, vos autem pru¬</l><l xml:id="m-252d69e6-85c8-4de4-b883-be65f0eb6f66" facs="#m-325e1ba9-64e4-4939-93b1-ca3641ab41c9" label="lyrics-like">déntes in Christo : nos infirmi, vos</l><l xml:id="m-2a8ccb50-4dac-4f35-9ac9-f1c4878dc868" facs="#m-f18b60d0-2e93-4bdb-ae6d-555d0ae2e784" label="ambiguous">vos haec scribo, sed ut filios meos</l><l xml:id="m-05f4705d-aa48-4a59-9b7b-a3decf23d783" facs="#m-c8b601ad-e41c-4e41-9b52-10d3bf50f1f9" label="lyrics-like">carissimos móneo. Nam si decem</l><l xml:id="m-00527827-9ee8-4efe-9152-4f849b950ffe" facs="#m-e76e3bf8-665a-448d-86a6-5995b01ba381" label="lyrics-like">autem fortes: vos nóbiles, nos</l><l xml:id="m-6f36c7c4-548a-4e48-9511-7447f197f13d" facs="#m-481cd1ce-a632-4fe4-84dc-03478f958fe7" label="lyrics-like">autem ignóbiles. Usque in hanc</l><l xml:id="m-ae457a0d-7ec1-4e66-b6c4-99dd8b8845dc" facs="#m-db12eef6-4063-4833-8dd0-646189b0c400" label="lyrics-like">millia paedagogórum habeátis in</l><l xml:id="m-bc1e9379-fa22-4fb7-a785-21194a347a14" facs="#m-307e074a-75b9-4539-acc4-65694345f1d0" label="lyrics-like">horam et esurimus, et sitímus, et</l><l xml:id="m-e6ba6908-0ba4-48f3-8a1a-6eeedbe86d2c" facs="#m-eddf36a1-2c91-453f-820c-6529b9981b54" label="ambiguous">Christo': sed non multos patres.</l><l xml:id="m-9b22a4aa-23ce-4df0-b25b-caf555f1b602" facs="#m-132986a5-95eb-41af-8204-cf8d5b80bce6" label="lyrics-like">nudi sumus, et cólaphis caédimur,</l><l xml:id="m-0c614f94-4185-441a-8ca7-55debf29df4e" facs="#m-34ae5ac6-e7a1-4f4e-a291-ce726d5accd8" label="lyrics-like">Nam in Christo Jesu per Évangé¬</l><l xml:id="m-79b5223a-43b1-4bd1-b8c5-512700cbf7a8" facs="#m-6c272df9-1de4-4cc5-8fe8-12d7f81eee00" label="lyrics-like">et instábiles sumus, et laborámus</l><l xml:id="m-45ee4b8d-685c-4869-9d62-7c7251b1bc3d" facs="#m-f08956ff-ff5e-4807-920e-ae9ade345afa" label="lyrics-like">lium ego vos génui.</l><l xml:id="m-4684faa5-f93d-4a3f-a41b-eb9b32bc89ba" facs="#m-096d059c-504f-4b49-bebb-84f781f555dc" label="lyrics-like">operántes mánibus nostris: male¬</l><l xml:id="m-7c512287-cff0-42b6-b957-5fdbee678dfb" facs="#m-83748bdf-5bf1-48e7-84c3-022136d59ec2" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Constitues éos. 1519. Allelúia, allel. V. Ego vos. p. 1487.</l><l xml:id="m-c4addc80-0d7e-4607-9ef8-81e83c4554a4" facs="#m-c465bc17-ca9f-4ff8-bc62-e522c5f6afd0" label="lyrics-like">Gospel. Accéssit ad Jesum. D. 1463.</l><l xml:id="m-645fd762-cc1d-469f-bf3f-6e8f5c36fb5b" facs="#m-31b8dcaa-ebc0-465c-b89e-fef686023eda" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-939dba73-90a2-4cab-9375-12432f3644e0" facs="#m-f42e85f3-7e5c-4259-bcde-7f231333782a" label="lyrics-like">offertory. In ómnem térram. D. 1327</l><l xml:id="m-17f50c69-efe4-4caf-804a-821551270b14" facs="#m-3e77ac5d-e2b3-4ec5-b99b-0e3d9bb08d8c" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-a73ad069-3626-4829-bc70-454650e359a3" facs="#m-1fcccc61-d63d-4099-8670-fd10f6021b4a" label="lyrics-like">Blatiónes pópuli tui, quaésumus  nostris non aptae sunt méritis, fiant</l><l xml:id="m-b693acdf-9c80-4f9f-b3c3-92dab6a56f33" facs="#m-d5d82219-4528-4a1a-b307-be2be76abaa5" label="lyrics-like">U Dómine, beãti Jacóbi Apóstoli l tibi plácitae ejus deprecatióné. Per</l><l xml:id="m-9981b9b9-7101-4067-809d-56b08605d339" facs="#m-f2283ed0-356e-4221-9241-98f32538acd0" label="lyrics-like">pássio beáta conciliet: et quae! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-973345a6-f03f-4f79-a119-3dee37e80095" facs="#m-e62d8229-5b61-4b21-be0b-39fa611332b7" label="text-like">Preface of the Apostles, p. 10.</l><l xml:id="m-d79ecb97-2066-42a9-a92a-07e5e9d19639" facs="#m-ea89e1c0-0283-4a26-a3c4-059ec016eb71" label="lyrics-like">Communion. Vos qui secúti. p. 1392.</l><l xml:id="m-08f909b9-1ab6-4f1e-8e56-402bfe42f27f" facs="#m-0f9f4806-0e9a-4a88-bc69-9ad76ef0a168" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-4a08d7d4-e5ee-48ea-ac18-2e15ac1f3f91" facs="#m-fa5de021-d3de-4a72-8cf1-8b3280a6e5e1" label="lyrics-like">REáti Apóstoli tui Jacóbi, quaé-l percépimus tua sancta lactántes.</l><l xml:id="m-d7e04def-0cb0-4609-8d17-64e3623a3679" facs="#m-fa710fe1-1abd-454c-aaa9-8363307cc612" label="lyrics-like">D sumus Dómine, intercessióne Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d8e38f58-9f3d-41d1-9ac3-d91a85cb46a1" facs="#m-c7d6e9a1-ea8a-40e9-aa54-562f5f670e22" label="lyrics-like">nos ádjuva: pro cujus festivitáte</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>